      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Phase-42 pipeline\n- `tesla_router_writer_failures_total` = router **write** failures (MQTT already acknowledged). These are observable here **only** and do **not** trigger MQTT redelivery.\n- Codec drops (`teslasync_codec_*_errors_total`) are decode-time; only outer payload unmarshal failures can redeliver.\n- Ingest path: MQTT → codec → `normalize.Pipeline` → router → L1 `signal.Store` → `signal_log`. No snapshot tables on the hot path."
      },
      "targets": [],
      "title": "Honesty — ADR-004",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
